    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ACC101 · Assessment 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14030 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ACC101 · Đầu điểm 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14030 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Presentation in class and report submission; OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">LO2, LO3, LO4, LO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Group problem solving: Suggestion: Using knowledge so far to find out the problem in financial management of any company at home or abroad, give explanation and find out the lesson behind ; OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Comprehensive exercise applying a business event; OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal Report of 1500-2000 words</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Thinking creatively, making decisions, solving problems,Personal qualities: Individual responsibility, self-esteem, sociability, self-management, and integrity. OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Either given by instructor or students are free to choose business cases<br>OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 10 — Individual Assignment Release</li><li>Session 30 — Individual Assignment Submission</li><li>Session 31 — Group Assignment Release</li><li>Session 58 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Session 59 — Group Assignment Presentation (cont)</li><li>Session 60 — Group Assignment Presentation (cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 10 — Individual Assignment Release</li><li>Buổi 30 — Individual Assignment Submission</li><li>Buổi 31 — Group Assignment Release</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group Assignment Presentation</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group Assignment Presentation (cont)</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group Assignment Presentation (cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
